@startuml
title 应用启动与状态恢复时序

skinparam shadowing false

actor 用户 as User
participant "Electron Main" as Main
participant "Config Loader" as Config
participant "Secrets Store" as Secrets
participant "App SQLite" as DB
participant "Service Manager" as Services
participant "BrowserWindow" as Window
participant "Preload API" as Preload
participant "Renderer App" as Renderer

User -> Main: 启动应用
Main -> Config: 读取非敏感配置
Main -> Secrets: 检查 Provider 配置状态
Main -> DB: 初始化 / 迁移应用数据库
Main -> Services: 检查 local-intel / 索引服务 / Provider 状态
Main -> Window: 创建主窗口
Window -> Preload: 注入 window.api.*
Preload -> Renderer: 暴露安全 API
Renderer -> Preload: getAppStatus()
Preload -> Main: system:status:get
Main -> Services: 汇总服务状态
Services -> Main: 状态摘要
Main -> DB: 读取上次页面和最近项目
DB -> Main: 应用状态
Main -> Renderer: 返回启动状态
Renderer -> User: 展示 Home 或上次页面

@enduml
